input operation writeSseEvent response HttpResponse
input operation writeSseEvent event SseEventName
input operation writeSseEvent data SseEventData
output operation writeSseEvent Int32
effect writeSseEvent write http.response
memory writeSseEvent arena request
async writeSseEvent no
useCapability writeSseEvent httpResponseWriter
responseBodyForwarder writeSseEvent data
purpose operation writeSseEvent "Write one framed SSE event to an already opened stream."
invariant operation writeSseEvent "Event id/cursor policy is application-owned; use data payloads that include replay cursor data until the stdlib id helper is added."
label startWriteSseEvent
call writeCall writeSseEventNative
argument writeCall response HttpResponse response
argument writeCall event SseEventName event
argument writeCall data SseEventData data
run writeCall
bind value writeStatus Int32 writeCall
return value writeStatus

# rationale: Low-level runtimeBinding hook used by standard.http writeSseEvent.
operation writeSseEventNative
input operation writeSseEventNative response HttpResponse
input operation writeSseEventNative event SseEventName
input operation writeSseEventNative data SseEventData
output operation writeSseEventNative Int32
effect writeSseEventNative write http.response
memory writeSseEventNative arena request
async writeSseEventNative no
useCapability writeSseEventNative httpResponseWriter
