purpose operation writeSseEventWithId "Write one framed SSE event with an explicit decimal id to an already opened stream."
invariant operation writeSseEventWithId "Cursor policy remains application-owned; this helper only emits the reusable SSE id/event/data wire shape."
label startWriteSseEventWithId
call writeCall writeSseEventWithIdNative
argument writeCall response HttpResponse response
argument writeCall id SseEventId id
argument writeCall event SseEventName event
argument writeCall data SseEventData data
run writeCall
