return value writeStatus

# rationale: Low-level runtimeBinding hook used by standard.http writeSseEventWithId.
operation writeSseEventWithIdNative
input operation writeSseEventWithIdNative response HttpResponse
input operation writeSseEventWithIdNative id SseEventId
input operation writeSseEventWithIdNative event SseEventName
input operation writeSseEventWithIdNative data SseEventData
output operation writeSseEventWithIdNative Int32
effect writeSseEventWithIdNative write http.response
memory writeSseEventWithIdNative arena request
async writeSseEventWithIdNative no
useCapability writeSseEventWithIdNative httpResponseWriter
operationBody writeSseEventWithIdNative runtimeBinding
responseBodyForwarder writeSseEventWithIdNative data
purpose operation writeSseEventWithIdNative "Low-level runtimeBinding hook used by standard.http writeSseEventWithId."
runtimeBindingPrecondition writeSseEventWithIdNative "response has an open SSE stream, id is non-negative, event contains no CR/LF/colon, and data is non-null."
